    {
      "is_best": false,
      "html": "<div class=\"post__content post__content--new-editor\"><p>Today it just says, “Don’t know”:</p><figure><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://uploads-eu-west-1.insided.com/stmicroelectronics-en/attachment/b916fbce-d83f-4b15-82a4-4bb9f68d3507.png\"/></figure><p> </p><p>That was just asking the question - without checking the ‘C0’ box before the query.</p><p>Checking that box gives pretty much the same as yesterday:</p><figure><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://uploads-eu-west-1.insided.com/stmicroelectronics-en/attachment/fe3dd2e7-d4ba-4366-93d1-834b643f130d.png\"/></figure><p> </p></div>"
